            "review_title": "Review at Kitchen By The River",
            "review_text": "Maria daifi\nSydney, Australia201 contributions\n0\nBeautiful river view restaurant\nMar 2026 • Solo\nDining at Kitchen by the River at Mia Saigon was one of the highlights of my trip. The setting is absolutely beautiful, with elegant decor and a peaceful river view that creates a very relaxing atmosphere.\nThe breakfast was by far the best I had during my stay — fresh, delicious, and full of variety. I also had dinner at the restaurant and loved every dish, especially the perfectly crispy seafood pizza, the grilled king prawns, and the chocolate tart, which was so good I ordered it twice.\nThe service was exceptional, with staff who were genuinely warm and attentive. A special thank you to Nhung, Nhu, and Anh for their kindness, lovely conversations, and for taking so many photos for me — such a thoughtful touch.\nI truly enjoyed every moment and would love to return again soon, hopefully with my sister♥️♥️♥️\nRead more\nWritten March 21, 2026",
