            "review_text": "1926yanks\nSeattle, Washington753 contributions\n0\nUnique Setting, Dishes with a Flair\nMar 2025 • Friends\nThis restaurant is in the 5* Mia boutique hotel. The outdoor seating is on the River & the busy city seems far away. \nWe started with a tasty pumpkin soup, then a beef salad w/lemongrass. We then had a tasty chicken w/bamboo & spicy side. The dessert of dark chocolate with raspberry sauce was great. Our waitress (I think her name was Tam) was polite & thorough\nRead more\nWritten March 7, 2025",
