            "review_text": "Grace Cruz\n37 contributions\n0\nScenic celebration\nJul 2023 • Friends\nWe had a memorable experience celebrating my friend's birthday at this scenic restaurant by the river. I only communicated for the preparations via WhatsApp with the restaurant while I was in a different country, and all my requests were provided. We especially appreciated the very courteous and excellent service of Phuong, too bad his shift ended before we finished our meal and we missed to express our appreciation. The food from appetizer to dessert was also great.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 15, 2023",
