            "review_title": "Review at Kitchen By The River",
            "review_text": "MyBellingen\nSydney, Australia77 contributions\n0\nMagical yummy moment on the river. THE place for a birthday celebration. Thank you\nJun 2023 • Family\nWhat a delight to be greeted with warmth, with emotional connections like if they know you, like if they care about you. They DID care about us for the whole afternoon and evening.. It was my husband 60th Birthday: we arrived by boat (astonishing trip from D1 to the restaurant). Another way to travel in Ho Chi Minh City. A complimentary flute of Prosecco, a yummy beautiful red velvet cake... We had dinner on the pontoon, by ourself, with the view on the river and the city. Golden time was magical. The food could have been officially a Michelin food. Light, well presented, and truly delicious. We had Hokkaido scallops, NZ mussels, tuna with pickled quail eggs...We will come back with our friends to showcase the view, the food and the warmth of the excellent caring service. Thanks Atila and team. Thank you\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 19, 2023",
