            "review_title": "Review at Kitchen By The River",
            "review_text": "Nick B\n28 contributions\n0\nThis restaurant is fabulous!….and seriously under reviewed!\nNov 2022 • Family\nWe stayed at Mia Saigon for 5 nights and the hotel is already very well reviewed and extremely well rated on trip advisor. However, compared to all the restaurants in District 1 (we tried the highest rated ones) their signature restaurant is amazing. Fabulous views, gorgeous menu, great service. We had the soft shell crab and scallops, followed by Iberico Pork and Wagyu Beef with some lovely sides. The desserts were also a knock out - the black forest was such a delight. All good value aswell. \n\nGet a cab if you are not staying at the hotel and try it. You will not be disappointed.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 4, 2022",
